OL,3,AMet Police boss 'wouldn't be surprised'
OL,4,Aif more allegations made about Brand
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe head of the Metropolitan Police has
OL,7,Fsaid he "wouldn't be surprised" if more
OL,8,Fpeople came forward to make allegations
OL,9,Fabout Russell Brand.
OL,11,FSir Mark Rowley also said that what he
OL,12,Fheard reported from Brand's trial at
OL,13,FSouthwark Crown Court came very close
OL,14,Fto "victim blaming".
OL,16,FOn Thursday, the entertainer and
OL,17,Fcomedian was found guilty of one count
OL,18,Fof rape and three counts of sexual
OL,19,Fassault.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
